  "typeCharacter": "Space Grotesk carries a precise, engineered voice: the h1 at about 7vw in Medium weight, sentence case and tight leading, section headings at 48 to 56px Medium, module labels at 20px Medium; Public Sans sets running text at 18px Regular and small notes at 15px, all sentence case, no tracking tricks.",
  "composition": "Hero on the deep #10151c field: h1 spans columns 1 to 8 over three lines in #e8ecf1, the lead below in columns 1 to 6, one signal-yellow #f2c230 square-cornered button 'Pokličite za brezplačen ogled' with dark text; columns 9 to 12 hold the ink-line conductor drawing (three parallel wires in brown #8a5a3b, blue #3b7be0 and green-yellow stripes bending at right angles to junction dots). Thin #2a323d rule at the hero foot. Next a full-width #f2c230 ribbon of short words in #151a21 (Novogradnje, Obnove, Omarice, Polnilnice, Strelovodi, Meritve), separated by small dark dots. Services on the light #f3f5f7 ground: heading columns 1 to 5, short note columns 7 to 12; below, the signature board, a #10151c panel spanning columns 1 to 12 with a 4 by 2 grid of white #ffffff modules separated by 2px dark gaps, each module topped by a small yellow rectangular toggle and a thin blue rail line, service name in Space Grotesk and one line of Public Sans where facts allow (Meritve, Sončne elektrarne with the partner note). Steps on white #ffffff: heading left in columns 1 to 4; columns 5 to 12 hold one horizontal #151a21 line with four round junction dots, each with a short step below (klic, brezplačen ogled, cena po ogledu, izvedba). Area on #f3f5f7: text columns 1 to 5, a schematic line map in columns 6 to 12 showing two soft regions (Šaleška dolina, Koroška) outlined in #1f5fbf with a single yellow dot at Velenje. Contact on #10151c: the phone as a large Space Grotesk numeral in #f2c230 across columns 1 to 8, email and the address Kidričeva cesta 55, 3320 Velenje in columns 9 to 12, the owner's name small; the one button repeated only here. Footer thin on the same dark field.",
  "imagery": "No photographs at all. One drawn piece: an ink line drawing of three electrical conductors in brown, blue and green-yellow striped running in parallel and turning at clean right angles, ending in small round junction dots and one terminal block outline, on the plain #10151c ground of the hero's right columns, apart from all text. The services board, step line, toggles and map are built as layout shapes and rules, not pictures.",
  "signature": "The services shown as a real distribution board: a dark panel of white modules, each with its little yellow breaker toggle, so the page itself becomes the new omarica that replaces old fuses.",
  "copy": {
    "headline": "Elektrika v vaši hiši, napeljana od omarice do zadnje vtičnice",
    "lead": "Izvajamo elektroinštalacije v novogradnjah in pri obnovah, menjamo stare varovalke z novimi omaricami in postavljamo polnilnice. Mojster elektroinštalater z licenco, ogled je brezplačen."
  },
  "imagePrompt": "One flat full-page screenshot of a desktop homepage, 1536x1024 px, no browser window, no device frame, no perspective, no photographs anywhere. Website for a licensed electrician in Velenje, Slovenia. Typography: Space Grotesk Medium for headings in sentence case, Public Sans Regular for body text. Section 1, hero, full-width deep near-black field #10151c: a very large three-line headline in Space Grotesk Medium, colour #e8ecf1, spanning the left two thirds; a short lead paragraph below in Public Sans #e8ecf1 at reduced width; one rectangular square-cornered button filled signal yellow #f2c230 with dark #151a21 label. In the right third, on the plain dark ground and separated from any text, a fine ink line drawing of three electrical conductors running in parallel and bending at crisp right angles, coloured brown #8a5a3b, blue #3b7be0 and green-yellow striped, ending in small round junction dots and the outline of a terminal block; no letters, no hands, no buildings. A thin #2a323d rule at the hero's bottom. Section 2: a slim full-width signal-yellow #f2c230 ribbon with a single line of short dark #151a21 words separated by small dots. Section 3, services, light cool grey ground #f3f5f7: heading at left, short note at right; beneath it, the signature element, a wide near-black #10151c panel across the full grid containing a 4 by 2 grid of white #ffffff rectangular modules separated by narrow dark gaps like circuit breakers on a DIN rail; each module has a small yellow #f2c230 rectangular toggle at its top, a thin blue #1f5fbf rail line, and a service name in Space Grotesk #151a21 with one small line of Public Sans #4d5864. Section 4, steps, on #ffffff: heading at left; to the right one long horizontal dark #151a21 line with four round junction dots, each with a short step heading and line of text below, not cards. Section 5, area, on #f3f5f7: text block left; on the right a simple schematic line map of two outlined regions drawn in blue #1f5fbf thin lines with one yellow dot marking Velenje, no labels painted inside the map. Section 6, contact, deep field #10151c: a huge phone numeral in Space Grotesk in yellow #f2c230 across the left two thirds, email and street address in #e8ecf1 Public Sans at right, one yellow rectangular button; a thin footer below on the same dark field. Asymmetric left-aligned layout on a 12-column grid, generous spacing, crisp flat colours, no gradients, no shadows, no rounded pills, no icons, no emoji, no people."
}

